<p>I like how weird and interesting this is, but I think the weakest part of it is that the laws just magically appear. A more interesting origin, even just vague allusions to one, would be preferable. Maybe play on how arcane legal systems can get, and have the dog and the laws keep showing up because the laws just exist, undocumented, in the law of loads of different countries because they all based their legal systems on whichever ancient state originally punished the dog in the first place.</p>

